{% schema %}
  {
    
    "name": "Section 3",
    "tag": "section",
    "class": "gps-635531734141633479 gps gpsil",
    "settings": [{"type":"paragraph","content":"Section design by GemPages. [Click here to start design](https://admin.shopify.com/store/photobrickusa/apps/gempages-cro/app/shopify/edit?pageType=GP_ARTICLE&editorId=635531734040970183&sectionId=635531734141633479)"},{"type":"select","label":"Section Preload","id":"section_preload","options":[{"label":"On","value":"true"},{"label":"Off","value":"false"},{"label":"Off Lazy Script","value":"off_lazy_script"}],"default":"false"},{"type":"text","label":"Checksum","id":"checksum"},{"type":"html","id":"ggWi0E6lAfS_text","label":"ggWi0E6lAfS_text","default":"<p>Walk into a home and you can learn a surprising amount about the people who live there. The colors, furniture, decorations, and artwork all reveal something about their personality. But while beautiful wall art can make a room look complete, the pieces that really catch your attention are often the ones that have something behind them.</p><p>A photograph from an unforgettable trip. A picture of a beloved pet. A car someone spent years dreaming about. A childhood moment that still makes the family laugh. These are the kinds of images that can become more than decoration when they are transformed into something you can actually build and display.</p><p>That is where a custom Memobrick mosaic can make your wall feel a little more personal.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggYfPM1SNQS_text","label":"ggYfPM1SNQS_text","default":"<p>Beautiful Décor Is Great. Meaningful Décor Is Better.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggrfu9Sl95Q_text","label":"ggrfu9Sl95Q_text","default":"<p>There is nothing wrong with choosing artwork simply because it looks good. A beautiful print can bring color into an empty room, create balance, or give a space a finished appearance. But artwork with a personal story can do something more.</p><p>It gives people something to ask about.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Imagine a guest noticing a colorful mosaic hanging on your wall and asking, \"Where did you get that?\" Instead of simply naming a store, you have a story to tell. Maybe it shows the motorcycle you built and rode for years. Maybe it captures your dog during one of their funniest moments. Maybe it is a photo from a family vacation that everyone still talks about.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The artwork becomes part of the conversation because it represents something that already matters to you.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggIyFqM9oJN_text","label":"ggIyFqM9oJN_text","default":"<p>Your Interests Can Become Part of Your Interior</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggrNCTIcwED_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggrNCTIcwED_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0375/0107/5595/files/b0a05271-0531-4db2-956e-c6617feb1a63.png"},{"type":"html","id":"ggrNCTIcwED_alt","label":"ggrNCTIcwED_alt","default":"Memobrick Photo Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"ggrNCTIcwED_title","label":"ggrNCTIcwED_title","default":"Memobrick Photo Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"gg8DZ8toEDb_text","label":"gg8DZ8toEDb_text","default":"<p>Personal décor does not have to be limited to traditional family portraits.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Think about the things you genuinely enjoy. Maybe you are passionate about cars, motorcycles, photography, travel, pets, sports, music, gaming, cooking, or art. These interests are part of what makes your space feel like yours, so why not let them influence the way you decorate?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A great photo of your favorite car can become an eye catching piece for a garage, office, or game room. A photo from a memorable trip can bring personality to a hallway. A portrait of your pet can become a playful centerpiece in the living room. Even a photograph from a hobby can become artwork that reflects something you spend your time enjoying.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>With a custom brick mosaic, the subject does not have to fit into a traditional idea of wall art. It simply needs to be something you want to see.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggjBxHO5SWu_text","label":"ggjBxHO5SWu_text","default":"<p>A Photograph Becomes Something You Can Build</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggAGDP2-GP1_text","label":"ggAGDP2-GP1_text","default":"<p>We are used to seeing photographs as flat images. They live on our phones, computers, social media accounts, and photo albums. Even printed photographs usually remain exactly what they were when they were captured.</p><p>A Memobrick gives that image a completely different form.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Your chosen photograph is transformed into a mosaic made from individual bricks. Instead of simply looking at a picture, you can see how the image comes together through hundreds or thousands of small pieces.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>That physical quality is part of what makes it interesting as décor. From across the room, the finished piece looks like an image. Move closer, and you start noticing the individual bricks that create it.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>It gives the artwork another layer that a standard print cannot provide.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg1c7mTehVp_text","label":"gg1c7mTehVp_text","default":"<p>The Best Wall Art Does Not Have to Match Everything</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggDK6HVsEDN_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggDK6HVsEDN_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0375/0107/5595/files/2300392b-5098-45c8-af8a-2b7e311acaa4.png"},{"type":"html","id":"ggDK6HVsEDN_alt","label":"ggDK6HVsEDN_alt","default":"Memobrick Photo Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"ggDK6HVsEDN_title","label":"ggDK6HVsEDN_title","default":"Memobrick Photo Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"gg0benTyPyh_text","label":"gg0benTyPyh_text","default":"<p>One of the easiest ways to make a room feel generic is to choose every decoration based on whether it matches the furniture perfectly.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Personal style does not always work that way.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Sometimes the most interesting piece in a room is the one that stands out. A colorful brick mosaic can add contrast to a neutral room, bring energy to an office, or give a hobby space a focal point.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The goal is not necessarily to make every object blend together. Your décor should also reflect the person living there.</p><p>That is why a custom piece can work in so many different spaces. The image, subject, colors, size, and placement are all connected to your own style.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggBCdXdQM3Z_text","label":"ggBCdXdQM3Z_text","default":"<p>Give Your Favorite Things a Place to Be Seen</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggiNyLORU8e_text","label":"ggiNyLORU8e_text","default":"<p>We often spend money and time on the things we enjoy, yet they remain hidden away in everyday life.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A motorcycle stays in the garage. A favorite travel photograph stays on a phone. A beloved pet appears in hundreds of camera roll pictures. A special car may spend most of its time parked outside.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Turning one of those subjects into wall art gives it a different role.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>It becomes something you can enjoy even when you are not riding, traveling, playing, creating, or taking pictures. Your interests become part of the environment around you rather than something that only exists in your memories or on your devices.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For vehicle enthusiasts especially, a larger Memobrick can be a great choice because additional space allows more details to be represented. Sizes such as 30x20 or 40x30 can give a car or motorcycle photo more room to show its shape, features, and surrounding scene.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggaTg8Ix0RI_text","label":"ggaTg8Ix0RI_text","default":"<p>There Is Something Special About Handmade Details</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggUpBU5DeWk_text","label":"ggUpBU5DeWk_text","default":"<p>Creating a brick mosaic is not simply about turning an image into a pattern and stopping there.</p><p>Technology helps us create it. People make sure we get it right.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>That human review matters because photographs can contain small details, unusual lighting, complicated backgrounds, faces, textures, and other elements that require careful attention. The goal is to make sure the finished mosaic represents the chosen image as clearly and beautifully as possible.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The result is something that feels more considered than an ordinary decoration. It combines the convenience of modern technology with human attention to detail.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggVA9dP6nTN_text","label":"ggVA9dP6nTN_text","default":"<p>Make the Artwork Yours From the Start</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggv52xfEl_s_text","label":"ggv52xfEl_s_text","default":"<p>The most exciting part of creating personalized décor is that there is no single image you are supposed to choose.</p><p>You can start with the photo that immediately makes you smile.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>It could be a portrait of someone important to you, a funny picture of your pet, a favorite vacation scene, your first car, your motorcycle, a childhood photograph, or even an ordinary moment that simply feels like you.</p><p>Then think about where you want to display it.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A larger piece can become the centerpiece of a living room or bedroom. A smaller mosaic can add personality to an office, shelf, hobby room, or hallway. The right choice depends on the image and the space you want to give it.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggEk5NJ16_O_text","label":"ggEk5NJ16_O_text","default":"<p>Turn an Empty Wall Into a Conversation Starter</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggMOl7lweXE_text","label":"ggMOl7lweXE_text","default":"<p>An empty wall is an opportunity.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Instead of filling it with artwork that could belong to anyone, you can choose something that instantly feels connected to your life. Something that makes you stop for a second when you walk past it. Something that visitors notice and ask about.</p><p>That is what makes personalized wall décor so appealing. It is not just about filling space. It is about making the space feel like it belongs to you.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A Memobrick mosaic takes an image you choose and turns it into a physical piece of art built from bricks. The finished result can add color, character, and a story to the room while giving you something genuinely personal to display.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Your walls do not have to be filled with ordinary decorations. They can show the things you love, the places you have been, the people and pets who matter, and the interests that make your home feel like yours.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Because the best art in your home is not always the piece that looks the most expensive.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Sometimes, it is the piece that gives you the best story to tell.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggEoX4GWeEB_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggEoX4GWeEB_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0375/0107/5595/files/John_R._It_was_a_fun_relaxing_task._My_wife_and_I_are_thrilled_to_have_our_wedding_photo_in_such_an_interesting_style.jpg"},{"type":"html","id":"ggEoX4GWeEB_alt","label":"ggEoX4GWeEB_alt","default":"Customize Memobrick Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"ggEoX4GWeEB_title","label":"ggEoX4GWeEB_title","default":"Customize Memobrick Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"ggii5080P9G_text","label":"ggii5080P9G_text","default":"<p><strong>John R.</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gglcGgYBoAb_text","label":"gglcGgYBoAb_text","default":"<p>&nbsp;It was a fun relaxing task. My wife and I are thrilled to have our wedding photo in such an interesting style</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggr3vAGbYwy_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggr3vAGbYwy_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0375/0107/5595/files/Aaryn_C._So_easy_to_understand_and_a_nice_relaxing_project_for_my_free_time._Can_t_wait_to_do_another_one.jpg"},{"type":"html","id":"ggr3vAGbYwy_alt","label":"ggr3vAGbYwy_alt","default":"Customize Memobrick Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"ggr3vAGbYwy_title","label":"ggr3vAGbYwy_title","default":"Customize Memobrick Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"